Tremere's is the premiere trading company operating out of [[Geography/Althane/Athrea/Thyropae/index|Thyropae]], and the only major trading company in [[Geography/Althane/Athrea/index|Athrea]] that's been able to repel [[Org/Althane/Alter and Associates|A&A]]'s attempts to buy or strong-arm them out of the business.

Unbeknown to most, however, is that Tremere's is run by a Vampire Cabal (the [[Org/Althane/Tremere Cabal|Tremere Cabal]]).
